WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.360
Aryabhata never kept a diary.

2
00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:05.900
But from ISRO's own records, it

3
00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:07.350
might read like this.

4
00:00:07.856 --> 00:00:09.336
Today I went up as a half

5
00:00:09.336 --> 00:00:11.616
size model, under a balloon from

6
00:00:11.616 --> 00:00:13.403
Hyderabad. Twenty five

7
00:00:13.403 --> 00:00:15.176
kilometres high.

8
00:00:15.176 --> 00:00:18.066
Not yet space, but a start.

9
00:00:18.490 --> 00:00:20.050
A helicopter lifted my

10
00:00:20.050 --> 00:00:21.410
engineering model over

11
00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:24.810
Sriharikota. Four models in

12
00:00:24.810 --> 00:00:26.830
three years, made by a young

13
00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:28.790
team who had never built space

14
00:00:28.790 --> 00:00:31.730
hardware. I come from a family

15
00:00:31.730 --> 00:00:33.120
of model students.

16
00:00:33.669 --> 00:00:35.229
Launch day.

17
00:00:35.229 --> 00:00:38.149
A Soviet Kosmos 3M rocket

18
00:00:38.149 --> 00:00:40.229
carried me up from Kapustin Yar.

19
00:00:40.229 --> 00:00:42.069
Three hundred and sixty

20
00:00:42.069 --> 00:00:44.949
kilograms, twenty six sides,

21
00:00:44.949 --> 00:00:47.199
designed and built in India.

22
00:00:47.578 --> 00:00:49.078
My signals were heard near

23
00:00:49.078 --> 00:00:51.658
Moscow, and at a make shift

24
00:00:51.658 --> 00:00:54.458
station in Peenya, Bengaluru.

25
00:00:54.458 --> 00:00:57.258
I carry experiments on X rays,

26
00:00:57.258 --> 00:00:59.978
solar neutrons, gamma rays and

27
00:00:59.978 --> 00:01:01.538
the ionosphere.

28
00:01:01.538 --> 00:01:04.218
A power fault let only one run

29
00:01:04.218 --> 00:01:05.168
at first.

30
00:01:05.593 --> 00:01:07.653
My mainframe worked on until

31
00:01:07.653 --> 00:01:09.260
March 1981.

32
00:01:09.260 --> 00:01:12.233
I re entered the atmosphere on

33
00:01:12.233 --> 00:01:14.533
the tenth of February, 1992,

34
00:01:14.533 --> 00:01:17.183
after nearly seventeen years.

35
00:01:17.953 --> 00:01:20.233
My picture stayed on the two

36
00:01:20.233 --> 00:01:22.355
rupee note till 1997.

37
00:01:23.021 --> 00:01:23.808
For GS3:

38
00:01:23.808 --> 00:01:24.871
Aryabhata, 1975.

39
00:01:25.601 --> 00:01:28.961
India's first satellite, built

40
00:01:28.961 --> 00:01:32.461
by ISRO, launched from the

41
00:01:32.461 --> 00:01:33.451
Soviet Union.

42
00:01:34.645 --> 00:01:35.725
India's first.

43
00:01:35.725 --> 00:01:38.515
Goodnight, diary.
